flowchart LR
  accTitle: Hypotheses about slow room-booking confirmation
  accDescr: Missing request guidance and requests arriving through several channels may lead to missing details and repeated clarification. Missing approval cover may create an approval queue. Manual calendar updates may cause inconsistent availability and further clarification. Each pathway may contribute to slow confirmation; these are hypotheses to investigate.
  checklist["No shared request checklist"] --> details["Missing booking details"]
  channels["Requests split across channels"] --> details
  details --> clarification["Repeated clarification"]
  clarification --> effect["SLOW BOOKING\nCONFIRMATION"]
  cover["No agreed approval cover"] --> queue["Requests wait for one coordinator"]
  queue --> effect
  manual["Calendar updated manually"] --> availability["Conflicting availability information"]
  availability --> clarification
  classDef effect fill:#002d74,color:#ffffff,stroke:#00a0df,stroke-width:3px;
  class effect effect;
